# Devnet: generated node homes/keys/logs, never hand-edited or committed.
networks/devnet/data/
networks/devnet/.venv-pystarport/
# ...except the captured block-time proof logs, which ARE the evidence.
!networks/devnet/proof/*.log

# tmkms: imported/generated private key material and signing state - never
# committed, regenerated fresh by networks/devnet/remote-signing/README.md.
networks/devnet/remote-signing/secrets/
networks/devnet/remote-signing/state/
networks/devnet/remote-signing/*.log
!networks/devnet/remote-signing/proof/*.log
